About Baringa&nbsp;

Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.

The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence - all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.

Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly - all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.

Certified as a&nbsp; Great Place to Work around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the Financial Times in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by Forbes for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.

Our Financial Services practice are looking for Summer Interns to join the team.

What you will be doing

Our eight-week summer internship program will kickstart your career in an award-winning&nbsp;management consultancy firm. You will gain an understanding of the consulting business model as well as valuable experience on aspects of the consulting project lifecycle, business&nbsp;analysis&nbsp;and client engagement techniques.&nbsp; &nbsp;

You will be part of a high&nbsp;caliber&nbsp;consulting team working alongside industry specialists, and other consultants on project engagements. Our clients&nbsp;range&nbsp;from&nbsp;&nbsp;global&nbsp;retail and commercial banks&nbsp;to&nbsp;asset managers.&nbsp;During the internship, you will also&nbsp;have the opportunity to&nbsp;work with Baringa colleagues&nbsp;on initiatives designed to help continue to grow our Financial Services footprint across the US.&nbsp;We will also provide you with a ‘buddy’ from the business unit&nbsp;you’re&nbsp;working for to ensure you have a friendly face to ask&nbsp;questions of during&nbsp;your time with us, as well as an advisor to guide you&nbsp;throughout&nbsp;your&nbsp;time here. &nbsp;

&nbsp;So, what are we looking for?

As part of the continued growth and development of our Financial Services consulting business, we are looking for individuals who are interested in delivery and advisory in all or some of the following areas:  &nbsp;

• Process Improvement&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Project Management&nbsp; &nbsp;

• People and Culture Management&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Change Management&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Business and IT transformation&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Data strategy,&nbsp;architecture,&nbsp;and management &nbsp;

• Agile delivery&nbsp; &nbsp;

Are you interested in gaining an understanding of consulting and technology delivery?&nbsp; Are you motivated to help&nbsp;leading&nbsp;financial institutions&nbsp;solve complex problems and pursue new strategies and opportunities?&nbsp;&nbsp;If the answer is yes, then we are interested in talking to you. &nbsp;

What's in it for you?

• Baringa is built around putting our people first.&nbsp;We invest in you, to ensure you&nbsp;remain&nbsp;the best in the business, through formal training,&nbsp;coaching&nbsp;and mentoring &nbsp;

• You can talk to anyone in&nbsp;the business. There are no barriers and everyone is accessible, from our Analysts to our Partners &nbsp;

